doc:Factsfact1_12 schema:text "Du et al. proposed a least squares support vector machine-based anomaly monitoring and alarm method for hydroelectric unit equipment to address high false alarm rates in traditional methods, effectively improving monitoring and alarm effectiveness by extracting vibration signal features." .
